# Liora Jewelry ??

A WordPress-based jewelry store website developed as a university project.

## ?? About the Project

Liora Jewelry is a jewelry store website designed and developed using WordPress.  
The website provides a modern interface for presenting jewelry products and includes essential pages and sections for an online jewelry business.

